 "A": {
  "raw": "[ The Scout 🕰️ Time 09:00 AM / UTC | 🗓️ Day 1 - Monday, 1st Jan | 📍 Old Road ]\n[ The Scribe 🕰️ Time 09:00 AM / UTC | 🗓️ Day 1 - Monday, 1st Jan | 📍 Old Road ]\n<prose>The Scout sets down her pack and studies the field ahead, where tall grass bends in long green waves.\n\n<span style=\"color:#ffb86c\">\"Wait here,\"</span> she says, <span style=\"color:#ffb86c\">\"and keep the lamp low until I call you.\"</span>\n\n**The Scribe|** <span style=\"color:#8be9fd\">\"Write this down. The clouds always know about the rain.\"</span>\n\nThe breeze picked up, tugging at the edges of her scarf while a gate creaked somewhere far behind them.\n\n<fate odds=\"45\" roll=\"80\"><pass>The plank holds. She crosses in a steady stride, boots finding purchase on every board. <span style=\"color:#ffb86c\">\"Easy crossing.\"</span></pass>\n<fail>A rotten board gives way beneath her heel and the whole bridge lurches sideways.\n\nShe catches the rail with one hand, scraping her palm raw while the Scribe shouts something she cannot hear.</fail></fate>\n\n**The unknown traveler|** <span style=\"color:#f1fa8c\">\"...Bit late for a visit.\"</span>\n\nThe traveler stepped out of the orchard with a lantern, her face half in shadow.\n</prose>\n\n<status>\n- Scout: Alert, palm scraped (-1 HP)\n- Scribe: Calm, watching the clouds\n- None\n</status>\n\n<cyoa>\n1. Ask the traveler who sent her.\n2. Walk back to the road.\n3. - None\n</cyoa>\n",
  "hostHTML": "<div data-component=\"MessageContent\" data-chat-image-targets=\"markdown html\" class=\"_content_1sdhd_1 _contentChar_1sdhd_14 mari-message-content\" data-ptx-hidden=\"\"><div class=\"_longMessageViewport_1sdhd_16\"><div class=\"_longMessageBody_1sdhd_45\"><div class=\"_prose_1sdhd_181\"><p>[ The Scout 🕰️ Time 09:00 AM / UTC | 🗓️ Day 1 - Monday, 1st Jan | 📍 Old Road ]<br>[ The Scribe 🕰️ Time 09:00 AM / UTC | 🗓️ Day 1 - Monday, 1st Jan | 📍 Old Road ]<br>The Scout sets down her pack and studies the field ahead, where tall grass bends in long green waves.</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#ffb86c;color:oklch(from #ffb86c clamp(0.65, l, 0.88) min(c, 0.18) h)\"><span class=\"_proseDialogue_1sdhd_222\">\"Wait here,\"</span></span> she says, <span style=\"color:#ffb86c;color:oklch(from #ffb86c clamp(0.65, l, 0.88) min(c, 0.18) h)\"><span class=\"_proseDialogue_1sdhd_222\">\"and keep the lamp low until I call you.\"</span></span></p>\n<p><strong class=\"_proseBold_1sdhd_212\">The Scribe|</strong> <span style=\"color:#8be9fd;color:oklch(from #8be9fd clamp(0.65, l, 0.88) min(c, 0.18) h)\"><span class=\"_proseDialogue_1sdhd_222\">\"Write this down. The clouds always know about the rain.\"</span></span></p>\n<p>The breeze picked up, tugging at the edges of her scarf while a gate creaked somewhere far behind them.</p>\n<p>A rotten board gives way beneath her heel and the whole bridge lurches sideways.</p>\n<p>She catches the rail with one hand, scraping her palm raw while the Scribe shouts something she cannot hear.</p>\n<div class=\"_inlineHtmlCard_1sdhd_670\" data-lumiverse-inline-html-card=\"\"><div class=\"mod-fate\" data-no-island=\"\"><span style=\"white-space:nowrap;font-weight:700\">Fate</span> <span style=\"white-space:nowrap;opacity:.85\">· rolled 80 · need under 45</span> <span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><b style=\"font-weight:700;color:inherit;padding:0 .45em;border:1px solid rgba(196,112,95,.6);border-radius:3px\">failed</b></span><span data-no-island=\"\"></span></div></div>\n\n<p><strong class=\"_proseBold_1sdhd_212\">The unknown traveler|</strong> <span style=\"color:#f1fa8c;color:oklch(from #f1fa8c clamp(0.65, l, 0.88) min(c, 0.18) h)\"><span class=\"_proseDialogue_1sdhd_222\">\"...Bit late for a visit.\"</span></span></p>\n<p>The traveler stepped out of the orchard with a lantern, her face half in shadow.</p>\n<div class=\"mod-tail\" data-no-island=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span data-no-island=\"\"></span></div>\n\n</div><div class=\"_htmlIsland_1sdhd_650\" data-lumiverse-html-island=\"true\" data-chat-image-targets=\"markdown html\"><div data-lv-mirror=\"\">\n<details class=\"mod-modules\"><summary><span class=\"mod-modules__icon\"></span><span class=\"mod-modules__title\">Active Modules</span></summary><div class=\"mod-tabs\"><div class=\"mod-tabs__rail\"><label class=\"mod-tab mod-tab--all\" style=\"--tab:#bd97e4\" title=\"Every module\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"mod-tab\" value=\"all\" style=\"\"><span class=\"mod-tab__icon\"></span><span class=\"mod-tab__label\">All</span></label><label class=\"mod-tab mod-tab--chars\" style=\"--tab:#89dceb\" title=\"Characters\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"mod-tab\" value=\"chars\" style=\"\"><span class=\"mod-tab__icon\"></span><span class=\"mod-tab__label\">Characters</span></label><label class=\"mod-tab mod-tab--notes\" style=\"--tab:#a6c2e8\" title=\"Scratchpad\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"mod-tab\" value=\"notes\" style=\"\"><span class=\"mod-tab__icon\"></span><span class=\"mod-tab__label\">Notes</span></label><label class=\"mod-tab mod-tab--threads\" style=\"--tab:#bd97e4\" title=\"Story Threads\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"mod-tab\" value=\"threads\" style=\"\"><span class=\"mod-tab__icon\"></span><span class=\"mod-tab__label\">Threads</span></label><label class=\"mod-tab mod-tab--plot\" style=\"--tab:#f5c2e7\" title=\"Plotlines\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"mod-tab\" value=\"plot\" style=\"\"><span class=\"mod-tab__ico