 "B": {
  "raw": "<think>\nContext: I am advancing the scene after the stumble.\n@Fate: Hauling the roll result into the narration.\nProse Plan: I will write the traveler's entrance and the Scout's reaction.\n</think>\n[ The Scout 🕰️ Time 09:00 AM / UTC | 🗓️ Day 1 - Monday, 1st Jan | 📍 Old Road ]\n[ The Scribe 🕰️ Time 09:00 AM / UTC | 🗓️ Day 1 - Monday, 1st Jan | 📍 Old Road ]\n<prose>The traveler raised the lantern higher, and the light caught the silver ring on her finger.\n\n<span style=\"color:#ffb86c\">\"I heard the board snap,\"</span> she said. <span style=\"color:#ffb86c\">\"Nobody crosses that bridge by choice.\"</span>\n\nThe Scout wiped her scraped palm on her trousers and met the traveler's eyes.\n\n**The Scout|** <span style=\"color:#8be9fd\">\"We were told the road was safe.\"</span>\n\nSomewhere behind the trees a bell rang twice, then fell silent.\n</prose>\n",
  "hostHTML": "<div data-component=\"MessageContent\" data-chat-image-targets=\"markdown html\" class=\"_content_1sdhd_1 _contentChar_1sdhd_14 mari-message-content\" data-ptx-hidden=\"\"><div class=\"_longMessageViewport_1sdhd_16\"><div class=\"_longMessageBody_1sdhd_45\"><div class=\"_prose_1sdhd_181\"><p>[ The Scout 🕰️ Time 09:00 AM / UTC | 🗓️ Day 1 - Monday, 1st Jan | 📍 Old Road ]<br>[ The Scribe 🕰️ Time 09:00 AM / UTC | 🗓️ Day 1 - Monday, 1st Jan | 📍 Old Road ]<br>The traveler raised the lantern higher, and the light caught the silver ring on her finger.</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#ffb86c;color:oklch(from #ffb86c clamp(0.65, l, 0.88) min(c, 0.18) h)\"><span class=\"_proseDialogue_1sdhd_222\">\"I heard the board snap,\"</span></span> she said. <span style=\"color:#ffb86c;color:oklch(from #ffb86c clamp(0.65, l, 0.88) min(c, 0.18) h)\"><span class=\"_proseDialogue_1sdhd_222\">\"Nobody crosses that bridge by choice.\"</span></span></p>\n<p>The Scout wiped her scraped palm on her trousers and met the traveler's eyes.</p>\n<p><strong class=\"_proseBold_1sdhd_212\">The Scout|</strong> <span style=\"color:#8be9fd;color:oklch(from #8be9fd clamp(0.65, l, 0.88) min(c, 0.18) h)\"><span class=\"_proseDialogue_1sdhd_222\">\"We were told the road was safe.\"</span></span></p>\n<p>Somewhere behind the trees a bell rang twice, then fell silent.</p>\n<div class=\"mod-tail\" data-no-island=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span data-no-island=\"\"></span></div></div></div></div></div>",
